# Monitoring Objectives

Objectives include detecting failures, improving availability, monitoring performance, tracking resources, reducing downtime, supporting troubleshooting, and capacity planning.

## Key Points

- Understand the purpose of monitoring objectives.
- Identify relevant monitoring measurements.
- Use monitoring information for detection, analysis, and troubleshooting.

## Example Flow

```text
System → Collect Metrics → Analyze → Visualize → Alert → Respond
```
